{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Begin The Cycle</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken within <i>The Abyss</i>, a world of unexpected and eldritch proportions, The <strong>campfires </strong>are  your only Sanctuary amongst the horrors that exist here. The rules of the cycle remain a mystery, But you've been granted 3 chances. Through <strong>combat</strong>, Scattered <strong>remnants</strong> left from previous cycles and your own gained <strong>knowledge</strong>, you might just learn why <i>The Abyss</i> called to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/extras/884f451b49a20483d0df9b4d53f4728a.poster.avif?t=1771582009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/extras/884f451b49a20483d0df9b4d53f4728a.webm?t=1771582009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/extras/884f451b49a20483d0df9b4d53f4728a.mp4?t=1771582009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Recruit The Prophets</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ones known as <strong>Prophets</strong> are both your most valuable resource and your only source of companionship within <i>The Abyss</i>. The Nine Prophets will <strong>teach</strong>,  <strong>gather resources</strong>, <strong>trade\u00a0useful items</strong> and <strong>fight</strong>\u00a0beside you.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Their deaths are permanent</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a prophet dies, Their sword is lost, along with their skills and knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/extras/33dd58c08d3852c2c41744a3ceb4d984.poster.avif?t=1771582009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/extras/33dd58c08d3852c2c41744a3ceb4d984.webm?t=1771582009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/extras/33dd58c08d3852c2c41744a3ceb4d984.mp4?t=1771582009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Prepare yourself</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not <i>only</i> mentally,\u00a0 But by Scavenging resources, Crafting Weapons, Armor, Potions, and  other useful items. You will grow stronger and try to stand a chance against the brutal monstrosities when you.......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/extras/303d3c39b5afb8522337ebaf1b98e264.poster.avif?t=1771582009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/extras/303d3c39b5afb8522337ebaf1b98e264.webm?t=1771582009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/extras/303d3c39b5afb8522337ebaf1b98e264.mp4?t=1771582009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Face The Gauntlets</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mist dissipates before you.  A twisted trial tests your mind, body, and soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Is this a sick form of entertainment? Or something more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survive the gauntlets and The Nine Prophets may yet escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail, and the cycle continues.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/extras/a63e5445bb5c7af4d89564b3107ec22e.poster.avif?t=1771582009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/extras/a63e5445bb5c7af4d89564b3107ec22e.webm?t=1771582009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/extras/a63e5445bb5c7af4d89564b3107ec22e.mp4?t=1771582009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119240?t=1771582009","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119240?t=1771582009","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/41be6e313b5f2a1a3abcdf88d4d72b41a2501e37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771582009","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119240/41be6e313b5f2a1a3abcdf88d4d72b41a2501e37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771582009","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Nine Prophets: The Abyss, depicts mutilated bodies, genital like appendages on various enemies, violence, dismemberment, death, and body horror. Viewer discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Begin The Cycle</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken within <i>The Abyss</i>, a world of unexpected and eldritch proportions, The <strong>campfires </strong>are  your only Sanctuary amongst the horrors that exist here. The rules of the cycle remain a mystery, But 